  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">TLAQ Trinidad and Tobago E-commerce Strategy Development Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Following a request by the Ministry of Trade and Industry, this project aims to develop a national E-commerce Strategy (ECS) for Trinidad and Tobago, to replace the previous strategy (2017-2021) which has come to an end. The project is delivered under the UNCTAD E-commerce and Digital Economy (ECDE) Programme.</narrative>
  </description>
